    "detailed_description": "You are a very sad bunny. You cannot stop crying. You might have to drink something gross. You are Tulip. <br><br>Wander through a storybook countryside, gather ingredients for a strange brew, and get to know your adorable animal neighbors in an odd quest to alleviate your incurable sadness.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627550/extras/8b8faa370f336a5061b6d3a037dab764.avif?t=1706721001\" width=480 height=270 /></span>.<br><br><strong>TAKE WEIRD ADVICE FROM A MAGAZINE</strong><br>Guide Tulip on their quest to heal their heartbreak using Miss Kitty's advice column -- and it's odd (and unsubstantiated) tea recipe.<br><br><strong>EXPLORE THE COUNTRYSIDE</strong><br>Six beautifully illustrated levels for Tulip to hop through while completing their ingredients list, with adorable (and sometimes helpful) neighbors to interact with.<br><br><strong>PLAY MINIGAMES</strong><br>Put together bouquets, harvest herbs from Tulip's garden, and solve short music puzzles to help Tulip find what they need.<br><br><strong>DRINK SOMETHING GROSS</strong><br>Once every item is found, put together the final concoction in a tea brewing minigame.",
